# Input

```scss
.a::after {
  content:attr( #{$name} );
  content: attr(data-#{$name});
  content: attr(#{$name}-Label   raw-string);
  content: attr(#{$name} type(<number>),0);
}

```


# Formatted

```scss
.a::after {
	content: attr(#{$name});
	content: attr(data-#{$name});
	content: attr(#{$name}-Label raw-string);
	content: attr(#{$name} type(<number>), 0);
}

```
